1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,220
Narrator: Listen to a librarian talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,040
Librarian: Attention please.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,660
Student cards will be handed to you fully activated

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,040
which means you can borrow materials right away.

5
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:15,240
But I'd like you to fill out an application

6
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:20,030
so that your card will not expire after the introductory period.

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:25,070
Fill out the easy online application with your barcode ready.

8
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:30,260
You can also use your card online to reserve or renew books.
